\begin{description}
\item[* name:] TDoDeletion
\item[* relevant examples:] \mbox{}\\
1. he does (never) go to the cinema $\rightarrow$ he 
never goes to the cinema, \\
2. she does almost make the day begin $\rightarrow$ she 
almost makes the day begin, \\
3. Who did go away $\rightarrow$ Who went away
\item[* language:] (Dutch, English, Spanish) English
\item[* kind of rule:] (M-rule, S-rule, Transferrule) M-rule
\item[* subgrammar:] CLAUSEtoSENTENCE
\item[* class:] (name of rule, transformation or filter class) TC\_Dodeletion
\item[* date of creation:] 9-JUN-1988 12:00:31  
\item[* author:] margreet sanders
\item[* copied from:]
\item[* modification:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
